OL,3,GNEWSACan this 'seaside resort without
OL,4,Athe sea' work for everyone?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are few places like Matlock Bath.
OL,8,FAn estimated 1.6 million people flock
OL,9,Fto the village each year. It is often
OL,10,Fdubbed Derbyshire's "inland seaside
OL,11,Fresort", or the "seaside resort without
OL,12,Fthe sea", given it sits roughly 70
OL,13,Fmiles from the nearest coastline.
OL,15,FVisitors are attracted by its theme
OL,16,Fpark, cable cars, amusement arcades and
OL,17,Fthe aquarium - but also the allure of
OL,18,Fgentle strolls through historic
OL,19,Friverside parks to demanding yomps over
OL,20,Fthe mountainous countryside.
OL,22,FAnd of course, fish and chips.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
